rooms_desc ({"The wizards play room.","A room in which Warmaster may store his valuables until he needs them.","This is the dungeon room of Warmaster's residence. Here one can experienceall the kinky things in life. A whipping machine lies against one wall. Streaksof blood dull it's metal surface.On the east wall is a set of manacles - just about the right size for YOU.","Y","pattern on the floor and a bench jutting out from halfway up the southern wall.The west wall is lined with cupboards and shelves holding all kinds of goodiesand bits an pieces. Along the north wall are a fridge, a stove and more cupboards.On the bench is a coffepot full of rich steaming coffee which makes your noseitch with anticipation. Also on the bench is a knife rack holding many sharpand wicked looking knives.Beside the knife rack is a bowl of fruit.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","After much walking you have reached a village. The land all around remainsmuch as it has been so far, flat and featureless. Overhead the rains continueto fall. The grasses also continue here and it is obvious that the village is deserted. All the huts are in disrepair and many are falling down. You wonder what has happened to the occupants of this village? Surely that gruesome stonecould not have taken them all? You feel fear as you wander through the villagefor there is not a single scrap of clothing or implement to identify who mighthave lived here. It is as if they never were. They have passed and none shallknow.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"the wiz playroom","A storage room","This is the dungeon room. All those whips and chains.  ;)","","This large airy room is very obviously a kitchen. It has a black and white tile","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A deserted village",0,0,0,})
