items ({({"rain","Large drops of water which are spattering down all around you","clouds","Heavy dark clouds which more than threaten that a flood is coming","land","Totally flat and desolate the earth is covered with waist high grass","field","A field of long grass, all long dead from lack of water","grass","Waist high grass all dead and browned from lack of rain","ground","The earth is packed hard. You wonder how anything could ever grow here",}),0,({"whipping machine","You examine the curious device and decide it is definately not for you.","manacles","leg and arm manacles designed so the person is placed just right.  :)",}),({"tv","It is on softly and is currently showing Roseanne re-runs","television","It is on softly and is currently showing Roseanne re-runs","vcr","An out of date model but it still works fine","table","A small coffee table with finely carved legs","coffee table","A small coffee table with finely carved legs","magazines","","magazine","","magazines","They are dominated by home maker magazines and are generally boring","prints","You recognize such famous names as Ned and Billy - whoever they may be","western window","Out of this window are panoramic views of the mages tower and it's surrounds","southern window","Outside this window stands Bilbo the hobbit who for some reason is very happy",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,})
